{"n": 1064, "w": 1000, "h": 764, "img": "1064.webp", "text": "5413010 REMOVING AND INSTALLING Disconnect plugs\n\nOR REPLACING MOTOR/GEAR\nUNIT FOR SUN ROOF\n\nUnscrew bolts and remove motor/gear unit\n\nDetach clamping strip.\n\nPull off trim carefully.\nUnscrew left and right bolts.\nInstallation:\n\nPaste trim.\n\nJastallation\n\nMark of switching gear (1) must be aligned with\nmark of control gear (2).\n\nLubricate teeth of pinion, control gear and\nswitching gear with grease*\n\n3054016 ; 730 54 046\n\nRemove control switch,\nRemove sun visors with holders.\nPull off edge guard partially.\n\nAdjusting Motor/Gear Unit:\n\nUnscrew nut (1) and adjust with socket wrench\nas described above.\n\nTighten nut to 450 * 35 Nm (39 + 3 in. Ibs.)\nCheck function.\n\n720 54 047\n\nClose sun roof.\n\nManual Operation:\n\nUnscrew nut (1) and turn drive shaft (2) with\n3 socket wrench,\n\nClose roof\n\n5413012 REPLACING MICROSWITCH FOR\nSUN ROOF MOTOR\n\nRemove and install motor/gear unit 54 13.010\nDrill out hollow rivets and rivet on mew micro\nswitch.\n\n* Source of Supply: HWB", "words": [["5413010", 0.2604, 0.0663, 0.3095, 0.0776], ["REMOVING", 0.3227, 0.0663, 0.3825, 0.0776], ["AND", 0.386, 0.067, 0.4098, 0.0776], ["INSTALLING", 0.4139, 0.067, 0.4813, 0.0782], ["Disconnect", 0.7513, 0.0683, 0.8045, 0.0782], ["plugs", 0.8085, 0.069, 0.8328, 0.0809], ["OR", 0.3222, 0.0822, 0.3374, 0.0935], ["REPLACING", 0.3419, 0.0822, 0.4043, 0.0942], ["MOTOR/GEAR", 0.4083, 0.0829, 0.4838, 0.0942], ["UNIT", 0.3227, 0.0988, 0.3485, 0.1094], ["FOR", 0.3531, 0.0988, 0.3749, 0.1094], ["SUN", 0.3789, 0.0988, 0.4002, 0.1101], ["ROOF", 0.4048, 0.0988, 0.4347, 0.1101], ["Unscrew", 0.7513, 0.0849, 0.7923, 0.0942], ["bolts", 0.7964, 0.0849, 0.8197, 0.0942], ["and", 0.8232, 0.0849, 0.8399, 0.0942], ["remove", 0.844, 0.0869, 0.8779, 0.0942], ["motor/gear", 0.8825, 0.0855, 0.9336, 0.0962], ["unit", 0.9387, 0.0862, 0.9559, 0.0942], ["Detach", 0.2604, 0.1313, 0.2938, 0.1419], ["clamping", 0.2974, 0.1313,